<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder down 3.4 pct as small players sell.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder down 3.4 pct as small players sell.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tea Smallholders Factories Ltd fell 3.4 percent, or one rupee to 28.50 on turnover of 8,500 shares, as small investors booked profit, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors have decided to book profits now, since they are tired of waiting for over a week for the share to hit 30 rupees,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Tea Smallholder Factories processes tea bought from small cultivators.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
